TITLE Transport SC question
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 1
    Cl 2
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 1
    Cl 2
SOLUTION 11
    pH 7 charge
    Na 1
    Cl 1
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant
    -print_cells 1
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 1
    -length 1
    -dispersivities 0
PRINT
    -reset false
    -status true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings sc
    10 PUNCH SC
END